{"quest_id": 6564, "name": "浮遊石への道程", "description": "浮遊石が大量に眠るという鉱脈を目指し、\n王子たちは坑道を進む。\n坑道に住まう魔物を蹴散らし、道を開け！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "浮遊石とドワーフの養娘", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920114, "map_no": 3302, "level": 70, "multiplier": 0.7, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 3, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2107552, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 989, "global_id": 988, "to_global_id": 985, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 3, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 76, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103920, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 2, "master_id": 986, "global_id": 985, "to_global_id": 987}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 2, "form_count": 3, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105232, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 988, "global_id": 987}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 20, "form_count": 2, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 76, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103920, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 2, "master_id": 986, "global_id": 985, "to_global_id": 987, "spawn_sec": 18}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105232, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 988, "global_id": 987}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 1, "hp": 364, "attack": 7, "base_hp": 520, "base_attack": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 7, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2099152, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 165, "global_id": 164, "spawn_sec": 41}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 2, "hp": 840, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 900, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 50, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111504, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 5, "master_id": 30596, "global_id": 4215, "to_global_id": 3857, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{}]}, "spawn_sec": 61}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 840, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 900, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 146, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103904, "race_id": 18, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 30238, "global_id": 3857, "ranged": true}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 2, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105232, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 1, "master_id": 988, "global_id": 987, "to_global_id": 985, "route_behaviour": {"transforms": [{"wait": 40}]}, "spawn_sec": 88}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 700, "attack": 210, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 30, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 76, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103920, "race_id": 18, "change_to": 2, "master_id": 986, "global_id": 985}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "マイン", "text": "はぁ、何でアタシが、\n道案内なんか……ぶつぶつ……。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "無理を言ってすまないな。\n疲れたなら休憩をとるか？", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "い、いや、気にすんなって！\n頼まれたからにはちゃーんと道案内するからさ。\nば、爆破しそうになったお詫びはしなきゃだし……。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "それにこの辺は、\n案内なしじゃ迷子になっちまうからな。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "マーヤ", "text": "そうなんですか……？\n確かにすごい入り組んでいて、\nまるで迷路みたいですけど……。", "face": "u338"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "坑道を拡張していると、古い洞窟や、\n魔物の住処にぶつかることもあるからさ。\n迷路って例えはあながち間違いじゃないかも。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "この辺にもいくつか、\n魔物の住処らしき場所があるんだ。\n気をつけて進まないと――", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "レアン", "text": "――いや、噂をすればというやつだ。\n結構な数の魔物の気配がするぞ。", "face": "u50"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "ひーふーみー……。\nちょ、ちょっと数が多くないですか！？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "マーヤ", "text": "でも……うん、密集してくるなら、\n遠距離から数を削ることも出来るかもしれません。", "face": "u338"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ともかく、放置することは出来ませんね。\n王子、この周辺の安全を確保してから、\n『浮遊石』の採掘場へ向かうことにしましょう。", "face": "ldbe7f0a6cdf4"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "マイン", "text": "あんたたち、スゴイんだな……。\nあんな大量の魔物をやっつけちまうなんて。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "スピカ", "text": "ふふ、でも油断は禁物よ。\nまだ全部の魔物を倒せたとは思えないし……。", "face": "u113"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "わ、わかってるって！\nぐぬぬ……調子狂うなぁ……っ。", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "マイン", "text": "ほら、先に進むぜ！\nこの先でグスタフのジジィが待ってるらしいから、\n待たせるとまたお説教されちまう！", "face": "u672"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね。王子、周囲を警戒しつつ、\n坑道の奥へ進みましょう。", "face": "ldbe7f0a6cdf4"}]}], "active": true}